    "question": {
      ":question/id": "c6732ae3-5361-592f-9e50-c388c8b4da9b",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)}{\\sec\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)}\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Rewrite the reciprocal denominator to expose a sine\u2013cosine product.\n\nSet $x=75^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(x\\right)}{\\sec\\left(x\\right)}=\\sin\\left(x\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sec\\left(x\\right)}=\\sin x\\cos x\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(150^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sin\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)}{\\sec\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)}&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
